# HVAC Vibration Monitor — project-level Kconfig

mainmenu "HVAC Vibration Monitor"

config HVAC_SENSOR_NAME
	string "Sensor node name"
	default "hvac-vibe-node-01"
	help
	  Human-readable name for this sensor node. Sent in every CoAP packet
	  header so the gateway uses it as the stable sensor ID. Max 15 characters
	  (stored as 16 bytes null-padded in burst_header_t).

source "Kconfig.zephyr"
